  "product": {
    "name": "BenchPress",
    "summary": "Press a button. Get a Frappe bench.",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "heading": "Overview",
        "body": "BenchPress deploys a Frappe bench from a template. An operator describes a lab\nonce — a Frappe version and a list of apps — and anyone with access deploys it,\nworks in it over SSH or a browser VS Code session, and destroys it when the task\nis done.\n\n- Self-hosted. One box, Docker, no external control plane.\n- Every bench reachable only over WireGuard.\n- Built on the Frappe framework, with a Vue 3 single-page app on the front."
      },
      {
        "type": "links",
        "heading": "Best Starting Points",
        "links": [
          {
            "urlPath": "/docs/user/quick-tour"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "heading": "Agent Guidance",
        "body": "Three tracks. Read `user/` for working inside a deployed bench, `operator/` for\nrunning the host, and `reference/` for the data model and the HTTP API. Start\nfrom the quick tour when you do not yet know which screen owns a task."
      }
    ]
  },
